Upstream history of the sync fixtures (sync_test.go), a stand-in for
brave/adblock-lists. Each section is a file of one commit, named
<commit>/<upstream path>; a commit holds its parent's files plus its own:

  x0  the base: the four vendored files and another list
  x1  child of x0: only the other list changes (a no-op bump)
  x2  child of x1: clean-urls.json changes
  x3  child of x2: clean-urls.json changes again
  pr  child of x0: an unmerged PR head (refs/pull/1/head), same four blobs
  r0  a new root with x0's files: upstream master after a history rewrite

master is x3 unless a fixture rewrites it.
-- x0/LICENSE --
Mozilla Public License Version 2.0
==================================

(A synthetic fixture license text.)
